Fuzzing challenges
•How to seed a fuzzer?
•(Ideally)seed inputs must cover different branches
•Remove duplicate seeds covering the same branches
•Some branches might be very hard to get past as 
the # of inputs satisfying the conditions are very 
small
•Manually/automatically transform/remove those 
branches  
